{"title":"Career Roadmap · Business Development Executive","role":"Business Development Executive","summary":"A Business Development Executive (BDE) identifies potential customers, develops business opportunities, builds partnerships, supports sales growth, and converts market opportunities into revenue. In an innovation and design-thinking pathway, the role also requires understanding customer problems, value propositions, solution design, market validation, and new-business opportunities.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Innovation & Design Thinking"},"about":[{"label":"Important","text":"Business Development Executive is an entry-level role, so graduates can enter directly. Strong performance is usually measured through qualified leads, meetings, conversions, revenue, partnerships, and customer relationships."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus","What changes"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Business foundations"},{"text":"Marketing, sales, communication, economics"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Lead generation, prospecting, CRM"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Business development"},{"text":"Account ownership, negotiations, revenue"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Strategic growth"},{"text":"Partnerships, key accounts, market expansion"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"BD leadership"},{"text":"Teams, territories, revenue strategy"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Commercial leadership"},{"text":"Business growth, strategic partnerships, executive leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business foundations"},{"text":"Marketing, economics, communication"},{"text":"Market research"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Sales fundamentals"},{"text":"Prospecting, pitching, CRM"},{"text":"Sales internship"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Business development"},{"text":"Negotiation, solution selling, analytics"},{"text":"BD project"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Innovation & strategy"},{"text":"Design thinking, GTM, partnerships"},{"text":"Business growth project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Organizational Behaviour"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the commercial cycle"},{"type":"h","text":"Market"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Problem"},{"type":"h","text":"Value Proposition"},{"type":"h","text":"Prospect"},{"type":"h","text":"Conversation"},{"type":"h","text":"Proposal"},{"type":"h","text":"Negotiation"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer"},{"type":"h","text":"Revenue"},{"type":"h","text":"Retention / Expansion"},{"type":"p","text":"A Business Development Executive should understand this entire process."},{"type":"h","text":"Innovation & Design Thinking Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the core design-thinking process:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Empathise"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the customer's real problem."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Define"},{"type":"p","text":"Convert observations into a clear problem statement."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Ideate"},{"type":"p","text":"Generate multiple solutions."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Prototype"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simple version of the solution."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Test"},{"type":"p","text":"Get customer feedback and improve it."},{"type":"p","text":"For BD, the important principle is:"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not sell a product before understanding the customer's problem."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Sales & Customer Acquisition"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical sales skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Prospecting"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lead generation"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Ideal Customer Profile (ICP)"},{"text":"Buyer personas"},{"text":"Account research"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Cold outreach"},{"text":"Email prospecting"},{"text":"LinkedIn prospecting"},{"text":"Referral generation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Lead qualification"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lead"},{"text":"MQL"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Opportunity"},{"text":"Pipeline"},{"text":"Customer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn qualification frameworks such as BANT and other modern qualification approaches."},{"type":"h","text":"CRM Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how CRM systems work."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lead creation"},{"text":"Contact management"},{"text":"Opportunity tracking"},{"text":"Pipeline stages"},{"text":"Follow-ups"},{"text":"Activity logging"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"},{"text":"Sales forecasting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with CRM platforms such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Salesforce"},{"text":"HubSpot"},{"text":"Zoho CRM"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The specific platform matters less than understanding CRM discipline and pipeline management."},{"type":"h","text":"Communication Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business email writing"},{"text":"Cold-call communication"},{"text":"Discovery questions"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Objection handling"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Follow-up communication"},{"text":"Proposal writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example discovery questions"},{"type":"p","text":"Instead of:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Would you like our product?”"},{"type":"p","text":"Ask:"},{"type":"p","text":"“How are you currently handling this process?”"},{"type":"p","text":"Then:"},{"type":"p","text":"“What is the biggest difficulty with the current approach?”"},{"type":"p","text":"Then:"},{"type":"p","text":"“What would an improved process look like for your team?”"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Business Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from basic sales to solution-based business development."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consultative selling"},{"text":"Solution selling"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Account management"},{"text":"Partnership development"},{"text":"Channel sales"},{"text":"B2B sales"},{"text":"B2C sales"},{"text":"Enterprise sales fundamentals"},{"text":"Contract negotiation"},{"text":"Proposal development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Development Metrics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead conversion rate"},{"type":"h","text":"Converted leads ÷ Total leads × 100"},{"type":"h","text":"Meeting conversion"},{"type":"h","text":"Qualified meetings ÷ Leads × 100"},{"type":"h","text":"Opportunity conversion"},{"type":"h","text":"Won opportunities ÷ Total opportunities × 100"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Acquisition Cost"},{"type":"h","text":"Sales & marketing acquisition cost ÷ New customers"},{"type":"h","text":"Sales cycle"},{"type":"p","text":"Time taken from initial prospecting to closing."},{"type":"h","text":"Pipeline value"},{"type":"p","text":"Total potential value of active opportunities."},{"type":"h","text":"Win rate"},{"type":"h","text":"Won opportunities ÷ Total qualified opportunities"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Strategic Growth"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Go-to-market strategy"},{"text":"Market entry"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Partnerships"},{"text":"Channel strategy"},{"text":"Product-market fit"},{"text":"Customer discovery"},{"text":"Business model innovation"},{"text":"Strategic account managem